        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It was Chinese New Year’s Day in 2019. Hundreds of millions of people were celebrating the holiday at home. But that morning, a team of engineers was racing to the centre of Shanghai. The wallthat separates a new tunnel of the Yuyuan Garden metro stationfrom the Renmin Road Tunnel had burst."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One of these engineers was Chen Biao, project manager for the Line 14 station. He joined the Shanghai Metro’s engineering team in 1991. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Chen remembers the new Yuyuan Garden station as one of his most challenging projects. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Construction",
            "ref": "v-construction"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of the station had begun three years earlier, in 2016. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " He helped the governmentwith "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "land acquisition",
            "zh": "土地征收"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "reviewed",
            "ref": "v-review"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " all the engineering plans. But most importantly, he was responsible for the project’s safety. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In fact, they had faced challenges in the project from the very beginning. These challenges were unknown to the public. One challenge was the station’s depth. The new tunnel had to cross severalunderground "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "structures",
            "ref": "v-structure"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Chen and his team had to build the station at a record depth of 36 metres. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " And halfway through the process, the workers noticed gas escaping from the open space. It was a mixture of several "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "toxic",
            "zh": "有毒的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "flammable",
            "zh": "易燃的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "gases, and it took a week to pump it all out. “It was easy to get "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "depressed",
            "ref": "v-depressed"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " when you were that deep,“said Chen. “There wouldhave been no way to escape if there had been a fire.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Fortunately, all the hard work paid off. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Today, the Yuyuan Garden station serves more than110,000 passengers every day. That’s even more than New York City’s busiest metro station, Times Square!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
